### Get All Posts

GET http://localhost:3000/posts

### Create the first post

POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "My First Post",
    "content": "This is the content of my first post.",
    "sender": "Chen"
}

### Create the second post

POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Another Post",
    "content": "Testing the filter feature",
    "sender": "Shiry"
}

### Get posts filtered by sender

GET http://localhost:3000/posts?sender=Chen

### Get posts filtered by sender #2

GET http://localhost:3000/posts?sender=Shiry

### Get posts filtered by id

GET http://localhost:3000/posts/696bcb39b193b0061a5fe57d

### Update post by id
## IMPORTANT: Replace the ID below with existing ID from the database

PUT http://localhost:3000/posts/696bcb39b193b0061a5fe57d
